SUMMARY:Daytime Pool at Black Diamond Billiards
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\n***Much l
 ike last time\, trying something different. Unlike Clifton Billiards\, thi
 s place has its own parking lot. They only do $20 day passes\, but it's su
 per laid back\, we don't have to check in with management to change tables
 \, and we can play as long as we want. This place also lets people bring t
 heir own food and drink\, so if we want to order from a local spot\, bring
  snacks or beverages\, we are able. If this ends up being too far out for 
 many people to join\, I'll do the next one at Clifton Billiards or closer 
 places going forward. Just wanted to see how this flew with the group.***\
 n\n\\*\\*\\* Expectations\\*\\*:\nPool cues are available at the location\
 , expect mid to low lighting.\n\\*\\* *What if I'm a beginner or only want
  to play with people at a similar level?*\\*\nTables will be divided betwe
 en beginners\, intermediate players\, and advanced. However\, this depends
  on how many types of players come\, so it will be divided as best as poss
 ibly available. If you would like game rules\, please speak with Marc.\\*\
 \* Marc is also available to answer questions including how to hold the cu
 e\, stances\, etc.\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\* I feel like people aren't trying to 
 be my friend.\\*\n\\*Please remember that different people have different 
 goals. Some may come to just play billiards\, others may be there to meet 
 new people or do something social\, and some may be there to make long ter
 m friends. Find people that match your goals or be ok with others that may
  not.
